		line=652,
	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=653,
	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=654,
	},
	{
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"eval", exp="g.no211=1"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030240"},
		line=654,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I lie down and close my eyes, but sleep refuses to come.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Kanami will return to being Empress Hisui come morning.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"And she will never live again as Tokita Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Is this outcome truly for the best?",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"All the sides of Kanami I saw today flash through my mind.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"She hasn't ever been the sort of person capable of exerting her will over others.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"She's just not suited for it.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The weight of the entire Empire is far too heavy for her delicate shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"But then, what am I to do?",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Kanami once suggested to me that we could just abandon everything and elope together.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"But alas, she should know better than anyone that there is no meaning in running away.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama? Might you already be asleep?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Kanami timidly raises a question from the other side of the door.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, not yet.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"The door soundlessly slides open, and her faint silhouette, illuminated by the dim light of the hallway, comes into view.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Having trouble sleeping?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Yes...”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Um, I thought I might wish to talk to you, if it would not be a bother to you...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't mind. I couldn't sleep either.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Might I come inside?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"She takes a single, shaky step into my room, but stops right there, refusing to meet my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why don't you come over and have a seat here?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...All right.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Kanami gingerly sits herself down on the edge of my futon.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I came to apologize for getting you caught up in my talk with Miyaguni-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“The last thing that I wished was to get you involved in all this.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"There's nothing I can say to her here.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"She has to make peace with it on her own.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am a reprehensible woman.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“And last night, I further sullied my soul.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Kanami trails off, her gaze never leaving the palms of her hands.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Her tiny hands are faintly trembling in her lap.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I... killed a man.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“These hands of mine still remember the sensation of that moment, even now.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“As soon as I close my eyes, it all comes flooding back: the smell of the blood, its heat burning my skin...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Kanami clenches her hands so hard that her knuckles turn white.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You did it to save my life.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But─”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's not all.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You avenged all those who perished during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All the regrets of those that died, those they left behind, you laid them to rest with your own two hands.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As a warrior, as your brother, I'm proud of you.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've never been more proud to have you as my sister.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Thank you very much, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Just hearing that alone is enough to grant your Kanami salvation.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But even so, I cannot possibly live up to the task currently before me.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am a reprehensible woman who impersonated the Empress, slew the governor-general, and nearly brought calamity upon the entire Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari already told you herself. All is forgiven.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“And on top of it all, I agreed to sell out the Empire to Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“In all of our history, has there ever been one as wicked as I?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What does it matter?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"I show her a beaming smile to cheer her up.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was right there with you, but I didn't lift a finger to stop it.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Doesn't that make me an accomplice to all your wicked deeds?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will accept and share in your sin.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No matter what becomes of you or the Empire, I will be by your side.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do you... truly mean that?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I do.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“And what if I head down an unrighteous path?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“If I betray the expectations of my subjects and lead the Empire to calamity, what will you do, Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Should that come to pass, I'll shoulder all responsibility...”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...and claim your life by my own two hands.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"I exchange my vow, more ardent than any expression of love.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"But it is precisely because I love her so that I refuse to leave this responsibility to anyone else.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I swore to live with her, and die with her, and ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"everything",
{"/font"},
" with her. And I cannot bear the thought of anyone else taking my place by her side.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am so happy.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Large, round teardrops spill over from Kanami's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am so very happy.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“To think that I could feel such joy, even at a time like this...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Am I allowed such a blessing?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course you are.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"To have the one you love take all responsibility when you commit a mortal sin that demands the ultimate requital─",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"To have them and them alone stain their hands with your blood and return you from whence you came─",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"There could be no greater blessing for those born within warrior society.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Haah...”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Kanami tenderly lays her hand over mine.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...Thank you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Kanami raises my hand and caresses it with her cheek.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami. Can I ask you just one thing?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Yes. Anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When you were bargaining with Elsa...”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Were you truly prepared to sacrifice all the people of the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Certainly not! I could never imagine such a thing!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It was all merely an act to convince Elsa-sama. Dealing with Okonogi did much to hone my acting skills.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I would make for a rather poor despot indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But if she really did go through with killing you...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Oomikami only knows what might have happened.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I really might have ended up declaring war against Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"A vision of the Empire and the Republic plunged into a war of annihilation flashes across my mind.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"All the Empire's lands razed to the ground, and the earth strewn with corpses as far as the eye can see.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"There Kanami stands amidst the carnage, all alone, her hands stained with blood.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"...She was about to destroy an entire country, all for my sake.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I gotta say, my little sister is one terrifying woman.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“For your sake, Onii-sama, your Kanami will do anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Kanami clasps my hand in both of hers.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Her hands are trembling no longer.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The heat in her palms radiates the intensity of her passion.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“For you, I would gladly stain my hands and sully my soul.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“For you, Onii-sama, I would accept being reviled by all the rest of the world.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"We gaze into each other long and true.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Kanami's eyes, glazed with a feverish passion, hold me in their thrall.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"All I see is her, and I can't peel my eyes away.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Her tender hands press themselves even tighter into mine.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, would you please...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Would you please heed one last request of mine?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anything, as long as it's within my power.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please... make love to me.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Kanami implores me, casting aside the last of her hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The two of us... are brother and sister.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“We have no blood relation.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"I know.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I know all too well, but I still have to say it, lest I get swept away by Kanami's desires.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've always treated me as your─”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have always...!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Her voice is so intense that I have to wonder where in her tiny body it comes from.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have always... yearned for you.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Not as a sister, but as a woman.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have always, always loved you.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“For three long years, I survived in the Imperial Palace with nothing but the thought of you to keep me going.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I accepted the sin of taking the Empress's name, the indignity of being Okonogi's puppet...”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Praying and dreaming that this day might someday come.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“This day when I could finally become one with you.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
