			{
"“Kanami...”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please... leave me with one last memory...”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Kanami stares at me with unblinking eyes.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"She survived countless lonely days in the Imperial Palace nurturing these precious feelings of hers.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
