			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"She looks up at me with moist, half-lidded eyes.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Slowly, slowly, they inch closer to my own...",
			},
		},
